WEBVTT

00:00:26.689 --> 00:00:32.612
And that's because what gets said,
and what doesn't, in our workplaces

00:00:32.653 --> 00:00:37.742
has a huge consequence for things
like ethical conduct,

00:00:37.784 --> 00:00:41.621
innovation, inclusion, talent retention.

00:00:43.372 --> 00:00:47.418
So more and more employees at the moment
are starting to speak up

00:00:47.418 --> 00:00:50.213
about social and environmental concerns.

00:00:51.005 --> 00:00:55.593
And this is great, but it's not always
going quite to plan for everybody.

00:00:56.511 --> 00:00:59.138
A finance director I've been working with,

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:03.059
he's been asking his employees
to speak up for quite a while,